2026-11-16): v1 of S. Zimath (schematic and placement, not fabricated) redrawn in the GapOne style with the review changes: BAT54W SOD-123, DC jack slots (his fix), R6 fitted / D4 DNP, R1n1 4.7 k, power flags, TSSOP-10 links, test pads 2.0 mm, part numbers as values, English names. Terminals J11-J18 (12.2 mm deep) and the FCH1040 4.1 mm land kept as v1 (S. Zimath, measured on the parts)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 220.98 68.58 0) (size 63.5 38.1) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type solid) (color 0 0 0 1)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3609779f-7a31-59b7-97f9-136a15593bf2")) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))) (embedded_fonts no))
